{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2078900859803750590","created_at":"2026-07-19T17:52:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2078900859803750590"],"id":"2078900859803750590","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4844,"like_count":79,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":15},"text":"等一个真心喜欢我的恋蠢癖","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2078900859803750590"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2078897845797875994","created_at":"2026-07-19T17:40:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2078897845797875994"],"id":"2078897845797875994","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":55,"impression_count":54278,"like_count":1086,"quote_count":26,"reply_count":86,"retweet_count":128},"text":"我非常喜欢那种有深有浅的人，能聊日常随意的内容，也能聊深层次的，而且不玩烂梗只靠自己本身的幽默感和温和热情来吸引人更是有魅力…和这种人玩就像是补充了一大杯能量饮料","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2078897845797875994"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2078896933645726104","created_at":"2026-07-19T17:37:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2078896933645726104"],"id":"2078896933645726104","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3677,"like_count":35,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"text":"不耐操的就约别我了。做没了半小就时说受不了，不行了，不要了。换了个从来没用的过姿势就太说深，力太度大了，腿压太酸了。机会只有一次，要想好自己承受能力再约我，要不然我会不高兴。欲望勾起来，却没得有到足够的释放，脾气会就变得暴躁起来。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2078896933645726104"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2078895728752234512","created_at":"2026-07-19T17:32:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2078895728752234512"],"id":"2078895728752234512","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2618,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"l我这个人很恶劣很骚贱很低俗","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2078895728752234512"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2078888271871160326","created_at":"2026-07-19T17:02:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2078888271871160326"]