别装作听不见我的痛苦 别总是搞乱我的心态 别突然扰乱我平静的生活又离开 别当坏人","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2078026978389787107"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2078023718811627818","created_at":"2026-07-17T07:47:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2078023718811627818"],"id":"2078023718811627818","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":6201,"like_count":92,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":12},"text":"我处理关系的方式就是不接电话也不回信息。而且我不回你信息怎么了，总比我狂发一大堆狂轰滥炸破防的信息好多了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2078023718811627818"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2078023461197525111","created_at":"2026-07-17T07:46:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2078023461197525111"],"id":"2078023461197525111","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2328,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"text":"讨厌和喜欢一样廉价","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2078023461197525111"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2077568949718520128","created_at":"2026-07-16T01:40:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2077568949718520128"],"id":"2077568949718520128","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3605,"like_count":55,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":4},"text":"我觉得我只有长长久久地一直写痛苦的文字才会让我感到幸福","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2077568949718520128"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2077568738812158272","created_at":"2026-07-16T01:39:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2077568738812158272"],"id":"2077568738812158272","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2631,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"很抱歉一直以来让自己这么痛苦。也许总有一天 你会像苹果一样开心的活着","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2077568738812158272"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2077455615589589177","created_at":"2026-07-15T18:09:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2077455615589589177"],"id":"2077455615